    "description": "Aga Khan University's Congenital Cardiac Programme - a multi-department collaboration - received the 2015 IQIC Improvement Science Award at the 11th Global Forum on Humanitarian Medicine in Cardiology and Cardiac Surgery held in Geneva from June 24-27, 2015.",
